{"page":172,"confidence":94,"text":"CONOCIMIENTO\nSOCIOCULTURAL\n\n 社会文化常识\n\n西班牙语国家的姓氏\n\n西班牙语国家姓氏的来源主要有 以下几种 :\n\n一、人名\n\n许多姓氏源自父辈的名字。人们在先辈的名字之后添加后绵, 将它们变为家族的\n姓。最常见的后缀是 -ez。例如 :Alvaro 一 Alvarez, Benito — Benítez, Fernando 一\nFernández, Gonzalo 一 Gonzalez, Hernando 一 Hernandez, Lope — López, Ramiro\n一 Ramírez, Vasco — Vásquez,\n\n二、地名\n\n地理名称也是姓氏的重要来源。这类姓氏可以由介词 de 与定冠词的组合与名词共同\n构成。例如 :Del Bosque, De la Morena 等。也有一些直接使用地理名词, UN Colina,\nCuevas, Lago, Montes, Montemayor, Prado $,\n\n三、动植物名称\n\n一些姓氏取自动植物名称,例如 :Toro, Lobos, Cordero, Castaño, Olmo, Robles,\nSilva, Flores 等。\n\n职业名称\n\n许多姓氏来自职业名称。例如 :Alcalde, Caballero, Camarero, Carnicero, Guerrero,\nMolinero, Obrero, Pastor, Sastre, Soldado, Verdugo, Zapatero,\n\n五、外来文化\n\n西班牙语国家文化是伊比利亚半岛文明、 阿拉伯文明、 拉丁美洲文明相互融合的产物。\n民族融合使许多外来姓氏进入西班牙语。例如 :Echeverrtia, Arizmendi, Goicoechea 源\n自巴斯克文化, Vasconcelos 来自葡萄牙文化, Alabl, Saca, Jara, Zamora 来自阿拉伯\n文化 , 而 Moctezuma, Nayarit, Paita 则来自拉丁美洲土著文化。\n\n157\n\n","lines":[{"text":"CONOCIMIENTO","confidence":96,"bbox":{"x0":710,"y0":482,"x1":1031,"y1":513},"words":[{"text":"CONOCIMIENTO","confidence":96,"bbox":{"x0":710,"y0":482,"x1":1031,"y1":513}}]},{"text":"SOCIOCULTURAL","confidence":91,"bbox":{"x0":711,"y0":523,"x1":1051,"y1":555},"words":[{"text":"SOCIOCULTURAL","confidence":91,"bbox":{"x0":711,"y0":523,"x1":1051,"y1":555}}]},{"text":"社会文化常识","confidence":96,"bbox":{"x0":208,"y0":485,"x1":688,"y1":595},"words":[{"text":"社","confidence":96,"bbox":{"x0":265,"y0":487,"x1":353,"y1":556}},{"text":"会","confidence":96,"bbox":{"x0":352,"y0":459,"x1":423,"y1":599}},{"text":"文","confidence":96,"bbox":{"x0":422,"y0":486,"x1":491,"y1":556}},{"text":"化","confidence":96,"bbox":{"x0":501,"y0":485,"x1":581,"y1":556}},{"text":"常","confidence":96,"bbox":{"x0":616,"y0":487,"x1":642,"y1":549}},{"text":"识","confidence":96,"bbox":{"x0":641,"y0":489,"x1":686,"y1":554}}]},{"text":"西班牙语国家的姓氏","confidence":96,"bbox":{"x0":299,"y0":878,"x1":896,"y1":939},"words":[{"text":"西","confidence":96,"bbox":{"x0":299,"y0